  "id": "assessment-instrument",
  "term": "assessment instrument",
  "definition": "An assessment instrument is a tool used to evaluate a person’s condition or level of risk by considering relevant factors. Its quality depends in part on whether it includes appropriate factors and shows good acceptability, usability, and content validity.",
